    "paperFeatures": [
      ["connective", "after"],
      ["pattern", "transitivity_failure"]
    ],
    "comment": "After is not unrestrictedly transitive. The paper's judgment is in prose: the result might possibly be held unobjectionable, but \"the following piece of reasoning is not\".",
